## Why This Is Asked

Cross-region locality is real; this tests ordering, fault tolerance, and cross-region controls with per-tenant isolation.

## Key Concepts

- Per-tenant locality constraints
- Vector clocks for per-tenant ordering
- Commit barriers and selective replication
- Idempotent apply and deduplication

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo per-tenant apply with idempotence
function applyEvent(tenantId, event, state) {
  const last = state[tenantId]?.seq ?? 0;
  if (event.seq <= last) return state;
  state[tenantId] = { seq: event.seq, data: event.data };
  return state;
}
```

